#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make test-only</command>.  Out of 4096 "
"tests, 25 in the 'parallel' test suite are known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make test-only</command>. Dos "
"4.096 testes, 25 na suíte 'paralela' de tests são conhecidos por falharem."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:174
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sf node /usr/share/doc/node-&nodejs-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sf node /usr/share/doc/node-&nodejs-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-intl=system-icu</parameter>: use the system version of "
"<application>icu</application>. Other values are <option>full-icu</option> "
"(to build a local, full <application>icu</application> library) and "
"<option>small-icu</option> (to build a local, minimal "
"<application>icu</application> library)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-intl=system-icu</parameter>: use a versão do sistema do "
"<application>icu</application>. Outros valores são <option>full-icu</option>"
" (para construir uma biblioteca completa local "
"<application>icu</application>) e <option>small-icu</option> (para construir"
" uma biblioteca mínima local <application>icu</application>)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--shared-{brotli,cares,libuv,nghttp2,openssl,zlib}</parameter>: "
"use the system installed libraries instead of local copies."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--shared-{brotli,cares,libuv,nghttp2,openssl,zlib}</parameter>: "
"use as bibliotecas instadas do sistema em vez das cópias locais."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--without-npm</option>: do not build <application>npm</application> "
"(use if you'd like to build a separate <application>npm</application> "
"later)."
msgstr ""
"<option>--without-npm</option>: não construa <application>npm</application> "
"(use se você gostaria de construir um <application>npm</application> "
"separado posteriormente)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nodejs.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--shared-http-parser</option>: use the system installed library "
"instead of a local copy."
msgstr ""
"<option>--shared-http-parser</option>: use a biblioteca instalada do sistema"
" em vez de uma cópia local."

